# C++ Expense Tracker

A menu-driven command-line Expense Tracker developed using C++.

## Features

- Add expenses
- List all expenses
- Calculate overall expenses
- Input validation
- Simple menu-driven interface

## Requirements

- C++ compiler
- C++11 or later

## Build

g++ -std=c++11 main.cpp -o expense_tracker

## Run

./expense_tracker

## Sample Menu

===== C++ Expense Tracker =====
1. Add Expense
2. List Expenses
3. Show Overall Total
4. Exit

## Purpose

This project was developed as part of my C++ internship to practice
C++ programming, input validation, data handling, and command-line
application development.
